WEBVTT

00:00:01.210 --> 00:00:08.390
Stepping out on
an ordinary Sunday

00:00:08.390 --> 00:00:14.890
Stepping out!
A miracle's gonna happen

00:00:14.890 --> 00:00:16.730
It's my day!

00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:27.310
Maybe I'll throw off my pajamas

00:00:29.770 --> 00:00:34.710
and head out to see her right now

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:42.090
I always turned my eyes away,
thinking she'd hate me

00:00:43.760 --> 00:00:49.490
Now I'm saying goodbye
to that negative attitude

00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:55.270
My favorite shoes
will always take me

00:00:57.770 --> 00:01:02.410
To a place where I'll be happy

00:01:04.580 --> 00:01:09.910
It's not someone else
I want to embrace

00:01:11.620 --> 00:01:16.050
But a version of
myself that's not fake

00:01:16.050 --> 00:01:19.120
I just want to walk

00:01:19.460 --> 00:01:22.660
Not on tip-toe

00:01:22.890 --> 00:01:26.630
Not downcast, either

00:01:27.600 --> 00:01:35.540
Just I'm stepping out
on an ordinary Sunday

00:01:35.540 --> 00:01:41.980
Stepping out!
Making a little try, try, try

00:01:41.980 --> 00:01:44.250
It's my day!

00:02:27.790 --> 00:02:28.490
Domyoji?

00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:35.930
It's dangerous.
Don't get so close to the edge...

00:02:36.330 --> 00:02:36.970
Please.

00:02:44.040 --> 00:02:44.880
Domyoji...

00:02:46.010 --> 00:02:48.750
You... hate me, don't you?

00:02:50.880 --> 00:02:52.320
<i>I don't hate you...</i>

00:02:53.790 --> 00:02:56.790
As far as I'm concerned, either 
you love me or you hate me.

00:02:58.420 --> 00:02:58.960
Domyoji?

00:03:04.830 --> 00:03:05.400
Later...

00:03:12.470 --> 00:03:14.610
No! Don't go!

00:03:20.510 --> 00:03:21.580
Domyoji!

00:03:26.620 --> 00:03:29.190
<i>No!</i>

00:03:32.220 --> 00:03:41.630
"Someday We'll Laugh..."

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:47.310
Tsukushi! Tsukushi!

00:03:48.870 --> 00:03:49.610
Tsukushi!

00:03:51.340 --> 00:03:53.910
You're awake? I'm so glad...

00:03:54.810 --> 00:03:57.420
What happened? Where am I?

00:03:58.080 --> 00:03:58.980
The hospital.

00:03:59.380 --> 00:04:01.920
They brought you here.
Don't you remember?

00:04:02.650 --> 00:04:05.270
You and Domyoji were found
tied up in the old gym.

00:04:05.270 --> 00:04:06.490
You were unconscious.

00:04:14.970 --> 00:04:20.040
<i>I... That's right! 
Domyoji passed out...</i>

00:04:34.790 --> 00:04:37.370
Tsukushi... What in 
the world happened?

00:04:37.370 --> 00:04:38.820
And what happened to your hair?

00:04:39.560 --> 00:04:41.160
Tsukushi! You shouldn't
be on your feet!

00:04:44.900 --> 00:04:45.800
<i>Domyoji...</i>

00:04:46.100 --> 00:04:47.170
<i>Am I too late?</i>

00:04:53.910 --> 00:04:55.270
Um... Domyoji...

00:04:57.480 --> 00:05:00.650
Hey, wait... Calm down!
Please calm down!

00:05:00.650 --> 00:05:01.550
Makino?

00:05:09.090 --> 00:05:10.520
Is it okay for you to be up already?

00:05:11.060 --> 00:05:11.760
Rui Hanazawa!

00:05:13.020 --> 00:05:13.890
How's Domyoji?

00:05:33.950 --> 00:05:35.910
Why won't you say anything?
Tell me!

00:05:40.020 --> 00:05:43.920
He's in the last room
in the VIP wing. Down there.

00:05:55.370 --> 00:05:56.870
And you know... 
Yesterday, Takeshi...

00:06:02.310 --> 00:06:05.110
VISITORS DECLINED

00:06:29.570 --> 00:06:33.140
You're too late, Makino.
He didn't suffer.

00:06:41.450 --> 00:06:42.150
No...

00:06:45.120 --> 00:06:46.950
He kept calling for you to the end.

00:06:48.320 --> 00:06:49.790
C'mon, go to him...

00:07:16.150 --> 00:07:17.850
<i>No... No way...</i>

00:07:18.850 --> 00:07:19.520
No!

00:07:20.420 --> 00:07:25.120
No! You can't die!
Open your eyes, Domyoji!

00:07:26.290 --> 00:07:29.160
How can I apologize to you?

00:07:29.830 --> 00:07:32.460
You may have been a jerk
with a bad attitude...

00:07:32.460 --> 00:07:34.270
...but I wanted you to live!

00:07:34.570 --> 00:07:38.030
Of course, I'm sure lots of people would be
happy about your death, but...

00:07:38.030 --> 00:07:41.010
Is that any way to 
talk about your savior?

00:07:52.750 --> 00:07:54.420
"No! You can't die!"

00:07:55.350 --> 00:07:57.090
The look on her face!

00:08:09.530 --> 00:08:10.740
Quit it, Makino!

00:08:10.740 --> 00:08:13.720
Stop it, Makino! Chill out!

00:08:13.720 --> 00:08:23.850
VISITORS DECLINED

00:08:15.610 --> 00:08:16.510
Now, stop it!

00:08:16.640 --> 00:08:19.710
Rui Hanazawa was in on it too!

00:08:23.850 --> 00:08:25.880
VIP ROOM: Tsukasa Domyoji

00:08:30.390 --> 00:08:31.020
Uh-oh...

00:08:36.760 --> 00:08:39.500
Damn! How can you do that
to an injured person?!

00:08:39.500 --> 00:08:41.000
My ribs are broken y'know!

00:08:41.330 --> 00:08:43.230
What kinda fool are you
sitting on my stomach like that?!

00:08:43.970 --> 00:08:47.410
<i>I'm so mad! 
I'll never forgive him!</i>

00:08:47.710 --> 00:08:49.110
That was an awful trick to play!

00:08:50.940 --> 00:08:52.380
Hey... Let's go.

00:08:52.710 --> 00:08:53.110
Yeah.

00:08:53.750 --> 00:08:56.480
Tsukasa... Leave everything to us.

00:08:56.950 --> 00:08:58.650
We'll pound the living crap
out of them.

00:08:59.650 --> 00:09:00.320
Hold it...

00:09:02.020 --> 00:09:02.890
Take this.

00:09:04.960 --> 00:09:06.920
"Attacker - ♪ Punches - ♪ Kicks"
Use of hard objects such as chairs preferred

00:09:07.460 --> 00:09:08.930
He counted them?

00:09:09.460 --> 00:09:13.000
I thought he'd matured some...
but he's as vengeful as ever.

00:09:13.400 --> 00:09:14.230
Hey, look at this...

00:09:15.730 --> 00:09:18.570
"The model's mine. Tsukasa."

00:09:19.170 --> 00:09:20.100
Just like him.

00:09:22.140 --> 00:09:24.980
Why the silence? It's creepy...

00:09:29.450 --> 00:09:29.980
Hey!

00:09:35.190 --> 00:09:36.890
Oh, so that's how it's gonna be?

00:09:37.190 --> 00:09:38.320
Well that's just fine!

00:09:38.790 --> 00:09:40.650
I should have minded
my own business?

00:09:40.650 --> 00:09:44.100
I should've just let you get beaten up
and de-flowered.

00:09:45.100 --> 00:09:46.730
Says the virgin...

00:09:47.800 --> 00:09:48.770
What was that?!

00:09:49.100 --> 00:09:51.540
Unlike you, I've had 'em
in all sizes and shapes...

00:09:51.870 --> 00:09:52.770
Don't lump us together.

00:10:01.610 --> 00:10:02.680
What?

00:10:06.220 --> 00:10:10.520
Repeat what you just said.
If you're lying, this'll tell me.

00:10:12.590 --> 00:10:13.160
Shut up!

00:10:13.520 --> 00:10:15.030
Like I need you telling me
what to do...

00:10:17.860 --> 00:10:18.300
Hey!

00:10:19.230 --> 00:10:22.030
And what's with you
always hissing at me?

00:10:22.530 --> 00:10:25.470
No words of comfort
for an injured man?

00:10:38.920 --> 00:10:39.480
It's just...

00:10:50.630 --> 00:10:51.900
W-what's the matter?

00:10:52.360 --> 00:10:56.730
I had a dream that you died.
I was so scared.

00:10:57.800 --> 00:10:59.700
I thought you died...

00:11:00.710 --> 00:11:04.410
After what I said,
I was sure you wouldn't come.

00:11:05.110 --> 00:11:06.610
But you came anyway,
like a fool...

00:11:10.820 --> 00:11:14.290
You were punched and kicked
by those thugs...

00:11:14.990 --> 00:11:16.990
I was sure you were dead.

00:11:18.520 --> 00:11:20.290
Then you went and played
that trick on me...

00:11:20.990 --> 00:11:24.530
<i>What's goiong on? She's adorable...</i>

00:11:25.130 --> 00:11:28.000
VIP ROOM: Tsukasa Domyoji

00:11:29.200 --> 00:11:30.540
I'm sorry...

00:11:30.870 --> 00:11:33.240
Don't rub your face like that.
You'll get scarred...

00:11:34.370 --> 00:11:38.180
You're so plain to begin with.
Don't cry, I said.

00:11:40.780 --> 00:11:42.810
I'd follow you to the 
ends of the earth.

00:11:43.450 --> 00:11:45.020
So quit fighting it.

00:11:46.280 --> 00:11:47.420
You funny-faced freak...

00:11:49.290 --> 00:11:50.020
Idiot...

00:12:22.750 --> 00:12:24.860
Now what? 
You suddenly look so scary...

00:12:40.340 --> 00:12:41.440
What are <i>you</i> doing here?

00:12:44.680 --> 00:12:46.340
<i>Could he be here to
finish the job?</i>

00:12:50.050 --> 00:12:52.750
Don't, Junpei...
Haven't you done enough?

00:12:53.120 --> 00:12:54.490
What are you planning?

00:12:55.920 --> 00:12:57.060
Move, Makino...

00:12:57.520 --> 00:12:58.060
B-but...

00:12:59.790 --> 00:13:00.790
What do you want?

00:13:12.800 --> 00:13:16.710
Don't worry, I'm not here
to make trouble.

00:13:20.480 --> 00:13:21.980
Are you here to apologize?

00:13:23.310 --> 00:13:24.080
I doubt it.

00:13:26.720 --> 00:13:30.220
Of course not! Are you kidding?

00:13:30.220 --> 00:13:32.090
I don't think
I did anything wrong.

00:13:34.960 --> 00:13:36.430
Compared to the boy

00:13:36.430 --> 00:13:39.660
who had his intestines crushed
by you in middle school,

00:13:40.060 --> 00:13:41.430
you got off easy.

00:13:46.900 --> 00:13:50.540
<i>You F4 think you're so hot.
Who do you think you are?</i>

00:13:52.440 --> 00:13:53.240
<i>What's with him?</i>

00:13:54.310 --> 00:13:56.850
<i>What's up? You wanna fight?</i>

00:13:59.280 --> 00:14:00.420
You're his...?

00:14:05.990 --> 00:14:09.130
<i>My stomach hurts... 
Help me, somebody...</i>

00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:20.970
That's right.
I'm his younger brother.

00:14:21.610 --> 00:14:23.740
I see. So this is revenge?

00:14:25.310 --> 00:14:26.310
What's he up to now?

00:14:27.110 --> 00:14:29.480
He transferred
to a high school in Kobe.

00:14:30.320 --> 00:14:31.820
So he's alive...

00:14:33.080 --> 00:14:35.620
As I watched you get beaten up,

00:14:36.320 --> 00:14:39.920
I wondered if you were the same person
who nearly killed my brother.

00:14:40.790 --> 00:14:41.660
What do you mean?

00:14:42.190 --> 00:14:44.880
Seeing you getting beaten up
for Makino's sake,

00:14:44.880 --> 00:14:47.870
I knew then that you weren't
the same person anymore.

00:14:49.630 --> 00:14:50.370
Whatever!

00:14:53.710 --> 00:14:55.140
So, are you satisfied?

00:14:56.140 --> 00:14:57.440
Yeah, I am.

00:14:57.880 --> 00:15:00.910
Then get out of here.
There's nothing else, is there?

00:15:05.580 --> 00:15:07.550
Don't ever try this again.

00:15:08.590 --> 00:15:09.920
If you know
what's good for you...

00:15:11.020 --> 00:15:15.290
Makino... I wanted to apologize
to you today.

00:15:16.530 --> 00:15:19.360
I did a terrible thing to you.
Forgive me!

00:15:26.340 --> 00:15:29.210
It's too late for apologies.
Get out of here.

00:15:38.320 --> 00:15:41.690
If it weren't for Domyoji
being in love with you,

00:15:42.320 --> 00:15:45.060
I would've wanted us
to be true friends.

00:15:45.990 --> 00:15:46.990
It's too bad.

00:15:58.940 --> 00:16:00.100
<i>Junpei...</i>

00:16:01.070 --> 00:16:05.940
<i>This was one of the three worst
experiences of my life,</i>

00:16:06.380 --> 00:16:09.010
<i>and Domyoji got it twice as bad...</i>

00:16:09.750 --> 00:16:12.250
<i>But, honestly, I think I understand
how you feel.</i>

00:16:13.580 --> 00:16:16.890
<i>Not that I'll tell you that now.
I won't forgive you yet.</i>

00:16:17.460 --> 00:16:18.860
<i>Maybe someday...</i>

00:16:20.360 --> 00:16:22.360
He's twisted...

00:16:22.730 --> 00:16:25.100
I was ready to flatten him,
but now I feel deflated.

00:16:26.800 --> 00:16:29.200
<i>You're just as twisted as he is!</i>

00:16:34.310 --> 00:16:35.840
Come on, wait up.

00:16:35.840 --> 00:16:37.680
Don't follow me!

00:16:44.050 --> 00:16:46.920
Why am I stuck with a geek like you?!

00:16:47.250 --> 00:16:51.060
That's mean!
Tsukushi tells me I'm swell.

00:16:56.630 --> 00:16:58.560
Evil Incarnate...
You snake in the grass!

00:16:58.900 --> 00:16:59.700
Hello!

00:17:02.570 --> 00:17:05.270
What do you mean, hello? You creep!

00:17:05.970 --> 00:17:06.970
He's shameless!

00:17:07.640 --> 00:17:08.810
Isn't he, Sanjo?

00:17:10.310 --> 00:17:13.280
Oh! He's handsomer in person!

00:17:20.320 --> 00:17:22.170
You're unfaithful! You man eater!

00:17:22.170 --> 00:17:25.290
How could you fall for someone
who tricked Tsukushi?!

00:17:25.920 --> 00:17:28.860
She's my one and only true love!

00:17:29.930 --> 00:17:30.960
Shut up, will you?

00:17:30.960 --> 00:17:33.130
Domyoji's my one and only, too!

00:17:34.000 --> 00:17:37.970
If it wasn't for Makino,
I'd gladly give him all of me!

00:17:38.570 --> 00:17:39.900
That flat-chested stick!

00:17:39.900 --> 00:17:42.010
True, Tsukushi isn't well endowed.

00:17:42.340 --> 00:17:44.140
This is the first time
we've agreed on anything, Sanjo.

00:17:48.510 --> 00:17:49.750
Hello!

00:17:50.380 --> 00:17:52.720
Well, pardon me
for not needing a bra!

00:17:53.250 --> 00:17:57.020
T-Tsukushi... that's not how I meant it!

00:18:02.230 --> 00:18:03.230
<i>But someday...</i>

00:18:04.860 --> 00:18:06.700
It's true!

00:18:07.400 --> 00:18:09.950
I know, Kazuya.

00:18:09.950 --> 00:18:11.370
I'm so glad...

00:18:12.970 --> 00:18:16.840
<i>Will we laugh together, someday?</i>

00:18:23.480 --> 00:18:24.680
That was a piece of cake!

00:18:25.080 --> 00:18:26.880
Hey... How you doing, Tsukasa?

00:18:29.320 --> 00:18:30.820
What about a piece of cake?

00:18:31.690 --> 00:18:33.860
Hold on a second. Where's Makino?

00:18:35.060 --> 00:18:36.860
Oh, everyone's here?

00:18:37.460 --> 00:18:39.360
Check it out, Makino!

00:18:48.840 --> 00:18:50.130
What is this?!

00:18:50.130 --> 00:18:51.900
Funny, huh? Nothing to it!

00:18:51.900 --> 00:18:54.350
It took just ten minutes!

00:18:55.010 --> 00:18:57.820
They weren't just weak!
They were wet noodles!

00:18:58.550 --> 00:19:01.020
Tsukasa... Did you really
get beat up by them?

00:19:02.320 --> 00:19:04.720
He got pounded into the ground!

00:19:05.120 --> 00:19:06.720
Makino! Why, you...!

00:19:08.160 --> 00:19:10.400
But Tsukasa, who's never lost a fight...

00:19:11.460 --> 00:19:13.460
To get beaten up over a girl...

00:19:19.300 --> 00:19:20.740
It must be love...

00:19:22.140 --> 00:19:24.940
<i>Yikes! I've been trying not to
bring that up...</i>

00:19:30.080 --> 00:19:32.000
They're releasing me
from the hospital today.

00:19:32.000 --> 00:19:34.290
The tests all turned out negative.

00:19:35.850 --> 00:19:37.340
Tsukasa's a great catch...

00:19:37.340 --> 00:19:40.120
He's got money...
Billions of yen in assets.

00:19:40.990 --> 00:19:42.330
<i>Billions of yen...?</i>

00:19:43.930 --> 00:19:46.600
He's probably the strongest of us, too.

00:19:49.100 --> 00:19:51.070
He probably won't cheat on you.

00:19:52.200 --> 00:19:54.130
Oh yeah, and when you're in trouble,

00:19:54.130 --> 00:19:56.610
he'll complain, but he'll always
come to your rescue.

00:20:00.550 --> 00:20:04.880
It's a once-in-a-lifetime chance
for an ordinary girl like you.

00:20:06.250 --> 00:20:09.420
A wealth very few girls in the world
can ever hope for.

00:20:10.020 --> 00:20:11.860
The upper class awaits you.

00:20:15.090 --> 00:20:16.770
Stop waffling and date him, will you?

00:20:16.770 --> 00:20:18.660
It's annoying, watching you two.

00:20:18.660 --> 00:20:23.130
B-but... I don't really care
about money much...

00:20:23.630 --> 00:20:25.400
Yeah, right!

00:20:25.400 --> 00:20:30.340
Money makes the world go 'round!
Just think about your family!

00:20:32.010 --> 00:20:35.880
He doesn't need to be strong.
I'm strong enough. Besides...

00:20:37.920 --> 00:20:41.320
Are you kidding?!
Look what those five did to you.

00:20:42.050 --> 00:20:45.820
<i>They're scaring me...
I've got to get out of here.</i>

00:20:46.420 --> 00:20:47.490
Hey, Makino!

00:20:47.790 --> 00:20:50.290
"Besides" what? Jeez!

00:20:51.500 --> 00:20:54.070
<i>I've got to say something... I've got to!</i>

00:20:55.570 --> 00:21:00.770
Besides, Domyoji's sort of like...
like... like a dog...

00:21:03.010 --> 00:21:03.710
<i>A dog?</i>

00:21:04.980 --> 00:21:07.210
A dog?

00:21:15.990 --> 00:21:17.320
<i>What a stupid thing to say!</i>

00:21:19.720 --> 00:21:20.730
A dog...

00:21:21.390 --> 00:21:24.000
<i>But, I was just so scared...</i>

00:21:26.000 --> 00:21:26.730
<i>A dog...</i>

00:21:28.130 --> 00:21:31.740
<i>Just the thought of him as my boyfriend
makes the future look bleak.</i>

00:21:35.370 --> 00:21:38.540
Hey! What's the matter, Tsukasa?
Pull yourself together!

00:21:39.080 --> 00:21:39.980
Hey, Tsukasa!

00:21:43.150 --> 00:21:46.120
<i>But, I have a feeling I have
nowhere else to run.</i>

00:21:47.620 --> 00:21:49.890
<i>You're in big trouble, Tsukushi Makino!</i>

00:21:57.730 --> 00:22:04.340
Will I ever make it that far?

00:22:04.340 --> 00:22:09.110
Yeah, I'm almost there.

00:22:10.910 --> 00:22:18.550
Some day, the whole world

00:22:18.550 --> 00:22:24.360
will have its eyes on me.

00:22:24.360 --> 00:22:32.130
Yeah, after our graduation ceremony

00:22:32.130 --> 00:22:37.740
we all wrote our dreams on the wall.

00:22:37.740 --> 00:22:44.380
A lot of time has passed since then

00:22:44.380 --> 00:22:50.750
but I'm just the same as I was on that day!

00:22:50.750 --> 00:22:57.660
Keep trying your best! 
Wishes can come true!

00:22:57.660 --> 00:23:06.530
Let's keep running down
 the road we believe in!

00:23:07.830 --> 00:23:14.440
Will I ever make it that far?

00:23:14.440 --> 00:23:20.510
Yeah, I'm almost there.

00:23:21.050 --> 00:23:27.790
Will I ever make it that far?

00:23:27.790 --> 00:23:31.160
Yeah, I'm almost there.

00:23:31.160 --> 00:23:37.030
I already made it this far, after all.

00:23:47.840 --> 00:23:50.040
A birthday party after Domyoji's release
from the hospital.

00:23:50.110 --> 00:23:53.910
I went, but something's not quite right.

00:23:54.480 --> 00:23:58.450
Fianc馥? Marriage?
What is this all about?

00:23:58.520 --> 00:24:01.850
I'm just here for a birthday party.
No one told me about this!

00:24:02.390 --> 00:24:05.390
Hana Yori Dango: 
"The Woman In My Life!"

00:24:05.690 --> 00:24:08.060
Can't I hold him off any longer?
